# C# + TDD (file-scoped)

**Full spec:** [`.cursor/agents/csharp-tdd.md`](../agents/csharp-tdd.md)

When editing `*.cs` under `Game/` or `Tests/`:

- Test-first (red → green → refactor)
- Invoke **`/player`** for orders, report validation, goldens, and docs refresh (`play/player/*.md` + `docs/human/rules.md`) before commit
- Invoke **`/project-architect`** when changing module boundaries or integrations
- Engine version: read `Game/Program.cs` → `EngineVersion`
